Description: Programmatic R companion SDK and quantitative ecology engine for
    VPro (VENUS -- Vegetation and Environment NexUS -- Professional) and the
    British Columbia Ministry of Forests Biogeoclimatic Ecosystem
    Classification (BEC) program. Provides concurrent SQLite WAL read access
    alongside the desktop VPro application, tidy vegetation and soil
    extraction, BCPlantTaxonomy v19 and BECdb v13 harmonization, community
    matrices, multivariate clustering, spatial GeoPackage export, LMH25 (2023)
    pedological validation, climr climate normals and Ministry actual soil
    moisture regime (aSMR) modelling, dual edatopic grids, BEC diagnostic
    synthesis, guarded candidate site-unit write-back, and Quarto BEC guides.
